  "“GTA 6 Switch Version PC Emulator 2026” repositories": "",
  "30+ copies": "",
  "Identical repos created within minutes of each other on Nov 19, each starred ~30 times by the other copies. They promote a “PC installer” download. Treat them as malware.": "",
  "gamescarletmaster.exe or any “GTA VI PC installer”": "",
  "Expect many": "",
  "Cyberleek says the executable is out, and fake “installers” are riding on that news; a scam kit built around one is reportedly for sale. Nothing plays GTA VI on PC yet, so a download that promises it is almost certainly malware. No project here hosts the game or an .exe.": "",
  "“GTA 6 PC Version” / “KytyPS5” landing pages": "",
  "Several": "",
  "HTML-only repos promising a ready-to-play PC version. None contain working code.": "",
  "Videos or posts of “GTA VI running on PC”": "",
  "Viral": "",
  "No project has booted GTA VI on PC, so a clip that shows it playing isn't real. One viral clip's “specs” text gave itself away as language-model output.": "",
  "Networks of cloned repos": "",
  "Installer lures and re-uploads sharing a name or description across several repos. Flagged automatically by the scout.": "",
